{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9723df66-84d5-87e4-87eb-aacebd1cee5b",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:18:14-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yuki Kim",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:16:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:16:39-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, good morning, dear. This is Yuki Kim, I'm on Bacheller Street, and I'm calling about the water again. It's over the curb and clear across the sidewalk down at the low end. One moment, sir, I'll be right with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:16:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, take your time. Bacheller Street, and the water's over the curb and across the sidewalk. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:16:59-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it. And this morning a delivery truck got stuck in it, right in the deep part. Big white truck. They had to wait a good while. One moment, ma'am, just ring that up for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:17:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds like you're at your register. Do you want me to hold on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:17:16-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, I'm back. Sorry. My husband and I used to get water there when the old cannery was still running, everyone did, but never like this. Oh, listen to me. Anyway. It's been since that nor'easter, the one Friday into Saturday, two days ago, and it just sits there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:17:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. So it's been pooling at the low end since the storm. Is traffic getting through at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:17:38-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Slow, slow as molasses. Cars crawl through it, one at a time, and people honk. One moment, please, hon. Yes, it's a crawl. I just want to know who I call to get it checked. Somebody should look at it, it's been two days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:17:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You called the right place. I'm putting it in for Public Works to have someone look at the drainage on Bacheller Street, 454 is the number you're at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:18:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "454, that's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:18:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the best number is 401-555-0183?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:18:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the store line, yes, that's me. Thank you, dear. One moment, sir."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:18:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Mrs. Kim. Somebody will be in touch."
    }
  ],
